<title>USA: Read-Rite &quot;pleased&quot; Applied bid withdrawn.</title>
<headline>Read-Rite &quot;pleased&quot; Applied bid withdrawn.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Read-Rite Corp said it is &quot;pleased&quot; Applied Magnetics Corp was withdrawn its hostile bid for Read-Rite.</p>
<p>&quot;We are pleased that they have withdrawn their offer, and are particularly pleased with the tremendous support we have received from shareholders, customers and employees,&quot; a Read-Rite spokesman said.</p>
<p>((--Wall Street Desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
